WEBVTT

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:15.540
Brother!

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.910
Let's chase 'em!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.700
Don't bite your tongue.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:22.540
Based on the route and speed,
it's Courier who has the charm.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:26.540
"Execution Department HQ"

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:26.540
Based on the route and speed,
it's Courier who has the charm.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:31.250
He must have gone there
to take something to Brother.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:35.910
Something important enough to be worth the risk.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.950
Sister must be with him.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.120
That's some sick deduction!

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:45.950
And by their direction...
I see... Kansai Station.

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:49.870
What a perfect place for me to snatch the prize.

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:55.080
Y-You've got that right!
Show 'em who's boss, ma'am!

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:11.750
"Akudama Drive"

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.040
"Kansai"
"Southern Skies"

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:29.750
"Kansai"
"Southern Skies"

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:29.750
They're Super S-Rank Akudama...

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.200
"Execution Department Helicopter"
"Octo Type 2"

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.200
They're Super S-Rank Akudama...

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.250
They're our enemy...

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.410
It's okay... It's okay.

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:38.500
Back then, Master said...

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.580
This is what I practiced for...

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:45.410
Why did she come?!

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:49.250
I gave her the chance to escape!

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:52.120
Bad news. Check out the screen.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.830
"Kill the Akudama!"
"Bring back peace!"
"No more Akudama!!"

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:04.750
"Death"

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.080
What's happening?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:10.950
Thirty-two hours ago, Swindler's appearance
in Dotonbori started a panic.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:15.290
Afterward, she posted on
a message board to declare war.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:19.370
Cutthroat followed up with
a killing spree to show support.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:25.040
Citizens started an uprising to
take safety into their own hands.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:28.830
You're kidding. That's all
it took to get this bad?

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:33.500
We're just as responsible as
the police for sparking this panic.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:38.700
Hijacking the airwaves to smoke out
the Akudama backfired on us.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.330
And Swindler planned on it.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:46.750
They probably even attacked HQ
just to rub it in our faces.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:51.410
That's right! They killed everyone
at HQ to serve as an example!

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:53.330
Not a chance.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.370
What do you mean?

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:57.580
Swindler isn't the type to kill for show.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:01.450
You don't know that! Akudama don't have hearts!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:05.540
That's why they have to die!
Isn't that right, Senpai?

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:09.200
From my perspective, you guys are the Akudama.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.620
--You little--!
--We pride ourselves

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:15.250
on crushing the crimes
and the heads of evil Akudama.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:20.700
Regardless of the situation...
I'll execute them one way or another.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:22.200
Senpai...

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:28.950
"Autopilot"
"Electronic Brain"

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:28.950
Boss is at the station planning our response.
We can't afford more failure.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:30.950
Stand down! Don't force us to--

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:31.700
"Kansai"
"Kansai Police Station"

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:31.700
Stand down! Don't force us to--

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.000
Stand down! Don't force us to--

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.910
What the hell are the Wanteds for
if you can't catch 'em?!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.580
--We've had enough!
--Kill all the Akudama!

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:42.870
You're supposed to protect us!

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.040
A massacre at HQ?!

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:49.540
What now? Shall we return?

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:52.000
No point in going back now.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:57.500
Will Swindler and the other Akudama
seriously go to war with Kansai?

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:02.620
You idiot! That's not the problem!
This damn uprising is the problem!

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:09.000
And it only happened because we didn't kill
the Akudama who stole the offering!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:15.160
Chief... Given the situation,
Kanto has certainly heard of it by now.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.580
Kanto?! Oh, God!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:22.250
Why do things like this only happen
when I'm the boss?!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:28.080
We must stamp this out at whatever cost!
If we can't, we're as good as dead!

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.290
They're getting away!

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.370
We know where they're going.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:38.750
Brother... I don't like being apart from him.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.790
Yeah, I know.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:45.290
"Kansai North Ward"
"Enoki Bridge   Suita"

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:50.250
Why'd you stop? Huh?

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.950
No one's allowed past but citizens!

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:57.120
Show your seals! You can enter
if you prove you're one of us!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.790
Who made that rule?!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:01.450
We're clearing the city of Akudama!

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:05.950
If the police and Execution Department
won't do it, we will!

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:06.950
Don't.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:09.910
What's wrong?! You guys got something to hide?!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:15.580
Identified as Super S-Rank Akudama:
Courier and Swindler. Warning! Warning!

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:18.540
Courier and Swindler?! For real?!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.870
It's the end of the line for you damn Akudama!

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:29.580
Declare the insurgents Akudama.

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.660
But they're innocent people
who haven't done any--

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:37.790
Innocent people?! Are they not
Akudama for starting an uprising?

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.120
Well...

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.830
We must protect Kansai at all costs.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:45.250
But for that to happen, justice must prevail.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:49.040
To have justice, must not evil be crushed?

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:52.200
Justice... To protect Kansai...

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.250
It will end the uprising.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:59.750
Though the heads of many Akudama will roll,
Kansai will once again have peace.

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.830
Unfortunately, Executioners can't
declare anyone Akudama.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.500
Give the word.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:10.290
Chief, only you have that authority.

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:15.540
Die!

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:19.660
Citizen 10173829 identified as Akudama.

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:24.540
--Citizen 10239446...
--Citizen 10183911...

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.830
...identified as Akudama.

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:29.660
What in the world?

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:33.620
Us, Akudama?! The Akudama are those--

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:37.790
Isn't your idea a bit off the wall?

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:41.750
To stop an uprising like this,
some pain is unavoidable.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:46.910
What about HQ? Not that
going back now will help.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:51.450
We're fortunate our fighters
were away handling the uprising.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:54.950
The office staff is easily replaceable. Hmm?

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.830
"Kansai Police Station"
"Entrance"

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.000
Warning! Warning!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.120
I ask so much of you.

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.540
Work is work.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:10.870
I just got this uniform back
from the cleaners, too.

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.700
Expense it.

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:16.410
Clean up the Akudama. Try not to shame me.

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:18.290
Yes, Boss!

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.830
"Flying Bus"

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:29.120
Huh?

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:37.290
Oh, yeah... Not even a bus crash could stop him.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:43.040
I wonder why he believed
all my stupid-ass lies...

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:48.750
500,000,000 years?
It's ridiculous just saying it.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.250
What a dork.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:53.580
Huh?

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:01.620
The guy tried to solve everything
with brute force.

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:05.200
I...

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:08.080
I...

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:11.750
I--!

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:17.290
What am I doing?

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:19.910
"Southern Kansai"
"Route 134"

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:23.450
Why were those people identified as Akudama?

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:26.620
Beats me. It's not our problem.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.950
But they're ordinary people.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:33.660
They were just trying to protect themselves,
and now they're Akudama.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:38.790
That's what Akudama are.
Isn't that your story, too?

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:42.040
Hmm? Courier! Since when did you know I'm not--?

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:49.120
You once asked me whether I'd give up my life
to finish a job or run away and live.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:52.700
Huh? Oh, yeah. That was sudden.

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:57.200
I would finish the job, even if it cost my life.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.830
Courier...

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:05.370
I kinda figured you'd say that.
Still, you remembered my question?

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.080
It just came to mind.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.910
Yeah? Oh, please!

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:09.750
You shit!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:13.160
Stop having fun, you two! It's not fair!

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.040
What's this?!

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:40.200
It's rare to see snow this early!

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.870
Snow? Snow! It's pretty and cold,

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.370
--Hey! Cut it out or you'll fall!
--but awesome!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.950
Boo!

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:52.250
Wish I could've seen this with Brother.

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:54.870
We're there.

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.700
"Kansai Station"
"Entrance Gate"

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:07.700
Are we pushing elevator buttons
at the same time again?

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.200
"Caution! Gate"

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:11.120
"Special Access"
"Open"

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:14.830
I see. VIP treatment, huh?

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:21.620
What are you doing? Get in!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.080
--Akudama!
--Tsk!

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.620
Brother!

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:41.120
Calm down, idiot.

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:46.500
I'll execute the Akudama.
All you've gotta do is watch the kid.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:49.120
Okay.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.040
It's the <i>Shinkansen</i>! It's so divine!

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:19.040
I guess even Executioners are fanatics.

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:21.040
There's your ride.

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:26.200
Back to where it all started.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:33.120
I had a lot of fun with you guys.
I even got a helicopter ride.

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:35.870
That's enough outta you!

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:37.080
What?!

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.410
We came to take Brother back.

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:43.080
No...

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:45.000
We came to steal him!

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.700
Swindler!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:53.200
Sorry, but you can't.
He's being shipped off to Kanto.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.410
Wait!

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:59.290
I will execute you!

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:03.500
It's my job to take 'em to Brother.
Stay outta the way.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:06.080
Relax! Relax! It's okay!

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:09.950
You guys coming to me
is all I could've hoped for.

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:12.910
It's all I could've hoped for, too.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.290
Huh?!

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:15.370
Tsk!

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:18.910
What are <i>you </i>doing here, Doctor?!

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:22.790
You can thank a certain someone
for delivering that charm.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.910
Don't tell me the charm--!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.290
Big Sis, look!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.580
That's how she tracked us?!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.410
You're the bastard who--!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:38.290
Sorry, but I refuse to waste time
on your petty grudges.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:41.330
I'll be done with you before you know it.

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:44.580
I didn't come here for a slaughter.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:49.500
I'm just a regular citizen now.
You guys can't touch me.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.870
Y-You're not an Akudama?!

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:57.450
Try not to move. I put a needle
through your heart.

00:13:57.450 --> 00:14:02.000
I'm holding the string of life.
One yank and your heart stops.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:02.950
Please, no!

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:03.870
You bastard!

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:07.750
Kill me and you're the Akudama.

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:13.790
You're only allowed to execute Akudama,
but only the police decide who they are.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.950
You don't get to make that decision.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:20.330
Senpai... I...

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:26.870
If you kill me to save your comrade,
you'll be declared an Akudama.

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:31.950
And what would your boss think
if an Executioner became one?

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:36.370
What do you want?!

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:39.120
I'm glad you're quick on the pickup.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:44.620
I want the offering to Kanto.
How about you bring me that vault?

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.290
Brother!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:52.950
Brother, we came to save you!

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.250
We'll get you out! Hold on!

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:57.000
--Why?!
--We'll open it!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.700
Why did you come?!

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:04.450
I... If I'm not with you...

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:05.870
Hoodlum?!

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:10.750
Sorry, lady! But I've got no other choice!

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:16.000
Don't even try. He'll cut Swindler's
neck before your bullet hits.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.370
Wanna chance it?

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:20.250
Go ahead. But I should mention...

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:26.910
I taught him how to cut the carotid,
and a good boy will do as he's told.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:33.910
Didn't I say to stop being such a feminist?

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:41.410
What a beautiful sight.
Everyone's lives within my hand.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:47.540
Now then... Bring me the child, eye patch.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:48.950
Tsk!

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:53.200
Hoodlum, is this what you want?

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:56.950
Using trackers... Being Doctor's
lackey... This isn't--

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:02.620
You don't know what I'm really like, lady.
This is the only way I know how to live!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:09.160
That's not true. Remember how bold and
fearless you were with Brawler around?

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:14.830
The second he's gone, you turn into a wimp?!
500,000,000 years, my ass!

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:20.450
You truly are a nauseating woman.

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:24.950
All your smooth talk like you're
some sort of heroine...

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:29.080
He needs someone to
latch on to--like a parasite.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:32.200
That won't change, no matter who it is.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:36.500
Don't conveniently assume...
you know how he feels.

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:40.950
I'm not assuming! Hoodlum admired
Brawler more than anyone!

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:45.830
And Brawler admired Hoodlum
just as much! Even I could tell!

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:50.120
Hoodlum, you might've been a hooligan
with a four-year sentence,

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:54.040
but to Brawler, you were the most
bad-ass Akudama there ever was!

00:16:54.040 --> 00:17:01.370
You were his bad-ass bro! So....
don't go back to acting like some hooligan!

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:14.700
Good God.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:18.330
In the end, you truly were utterly useless.

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:22.660
Though... you're just a bonus prize
after killing Brawler.

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:26.660
Huh? What... did you say?

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:29.080
Using you was the cherry on top.

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:33.910
Luckily, you were easy to manipulate
once the dreadlocked gorilla died.

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.580
Huh? What do you mean?

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:43.790
He died from the wound he got on the <i>Shinkansen</i>.
I stitched it so it would open back up.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.160
You're kidding!

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:49.080
After all, he was the biggest nuisance for me.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:54.120
Someone my drugs don't
work on is a pain in the ass.

00:17:55.120 --> 00:18:01.200
So, while he fought Executioners...
having the time of his life...

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:04.080
He died of blood loss.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:06.080
No...

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:11.120
That's crossing the line!

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:12.620
You fiend.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:15.620
You! You're the biggest bitch!

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:17.910
I don't wanna hear it from you.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:23.000
Hey, eye patch. Before you hand
over the kid, execute those two.

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.790
Piss off, you fiend!

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.080
I mean it.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:34.410
Unlike me, those two are Super S-Class Akudama.
You can slaughter them however you please.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:38.080
Don't tell me you sympathize with Akudama now.

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:41.450
Tsk!

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:49.540
You can't! She'll die if you do that! No!

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:54.580
Why are you protecting her?!
I'd only be executing an...

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:08.450
For crying out loud. Why can't
you people just do what I say?!

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:11.250
The... is... Kansai Station...!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.410
The radio? Aren't the waves blocked?

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:20.620
Come in! The crowd is rushing Kansai Station!
The <i>Shinkansen</i>! They're heading for it!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:22.120
What?!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:32.410
What the hell is this?!

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:33.750
Huh? Huh?!

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:37.120
What's going on?! I never planned for th--

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:43.790
I did it just like you taught me!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:54.700
You sure... fought against...
some tough dudes...

00:19:54.700 --> 00:20:03.290
You're... the best... Bro...

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.750
Please, take us to Kanto!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:09.330
--Save us!
--O' <i>Shinkansen</i>!

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.410
What's going on?

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:13.870
Hang in there!

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:17.500
Pull out... the needle, Senpai.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:20.790
If I do, you die! I'll get you help!

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:27.910
I won't let you die... I won't let you die!

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:31.500
You must... live on.

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:44.290
It's the <i>Shinkansen</i>'s mercy!

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:57.000
No!

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:03.000
Get on.

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:06.040
"Stopped"
"Kansai"

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:06.120
"Kansai"

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:06.910
"Departing"
"Kansai"

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:02.700
What a mess it's become out there.

00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:05.120
Guess they're coming to this side.

00:23:05.120 --> 00:23:05.910
Oh!

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:07.660
Hello! Bunny here!

00:23:07.660 --> 00:23:09.830
'Sup?! It's Shark here!

00:23:09.830 --> 00:23:15.790
Hey, Shark! Do you know why so many people
could get into Kansai Station?

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:19.120
Because Kanto wanted lots of people!

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:23.750
They threw the doors wide open
so that people could get in!

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:27.870
Right! It's what the <i>Shinkansen</i>
was originally made for!

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:30.830
Yup! Because Kanto is--

00:23:43.950 --> 00:23:46.950
Let's do this! It's game time!
